+## Categories restored in v4.1
+
+The child home screen again has category chips similar to the earlier v2 browsing experience. Daughter: Recommended, New Videos, Stories & Cartoons, Animals, Science, Numbers & Reading, Art & Making, Move & Dance. Son: Recommended, New Videos, Science, Animals, Engineering, Stories & Cartoons, Space, History, Art & Making, Numbers & Reading. Categories only filter the already-approved catalogue; they never perform unrestricted YouTube search. Recommended prioritizes unwatched videos and mixes channels to avoid long runs from one channel.
+
 ## YouTube Data API usage
 
 On first launch, enter the private YouTube Data API v3 key locally. The key is not compiled into the APK. The catalogue resolves each approved channel, reads its uploads playlist, then batches video details to check duration, embedding permission and Made-for-Kids status. `search.list` is used only as a one-time fallback if a channel handle cannot be resolved and the resolved channel ID is then cached.
